Package: kaspexample
Type: Project
Title: KASP Marker Design for Arabidopsis thaliana (TAIR10)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Lecture", "Demo", email = "demo@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An opinionated, reproducible pipeline for designing and quality
    controlling Kompetitive Allele-Specific PCR (KASP) genotyping assays for
    Arabidopsis thaliana. Pulls the TAIR10 genome (Ensembl Plants FASTA), 1001
    Genomes variation (Ensembl REST), designs allele-specific and common primers
    on either strand, and scores thermodynamics (TmCalculator, OligoArrayAux),
    Taq-aware allelic discrimination (DECIPHER) and genome-wide specificity
    (Biostrings, optional rBLAST).
